    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Sarah Mawas",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107515898212727035045/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL-FwYkwCwm02DF10TaSIig0h8VTD0zKDz1jv2988RtNVBLkQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I’m so surprised there’s barely any reviews about Cherry! Literally a gem. I did a mani&pedi shellac combo and she’s so meticulous and made sure the color matched my skin tone. I also spontaneously decided to get a head massage/hairwash and it was so relaxing! Cherry is so sweet and caring to add to her expertise. Prices are very reasonable. I’ll be back! Thank you Cherry!",
        "time": 1765561509,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "MJ Tadeo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117615110930699839036/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWjXFy_tRgbJFHcwS5MW0b0KLmv4D79uPJtdw1YypW29jkm8UhC=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I initially went in for a regular pedicure, but on a whim, I decided to go for the deluxe pedicure! It came with a long, relaxing leg and foot massage, which you seriously don’t find much anymore (even without the deluxe package, the massage for the regular pedicure was just as relaxing). My legs and feet feel softer than a baby’s bottom, thanks to the exfoliation they did—it was next-level.\n\nVivian was my technician, and she was an absolute sweetheart! Super professional, really detailed, and kept checking in with me to make sure I was loving everything (which I definitely was). She put so much care into every step, and I walked out feeling like I was floating.\n\nThe vibe at the spa is chef’s kiss. It’s so clean, bright, and beautifully designed—it felt like a little escape. The entire staff greeted me with huge smiles the moment I walked in, and their hospitality was 10/10. Oh, and the cherry on top? They gave me a cute gift bag with two gorgeous nail polishes.\n\nI’m all about supporting local businesses, and this one deserves all the love. Plus, they’re offering a special discount for the next two weeks, so don’t walk… RUN—go pamper yourself ASAP!",
        "time": 1730313428,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lena Kosyakova",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114287185462504816803/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUyEHHsaRyROZAfdYkqgWbU-iY9eYjSWvtL_Tj6zaoJEKRxUFp2Eg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "The pictures showing the result of pedicure explains my rating. In addition, when they used cuticle softener and cuticle oil (at the last step), they used shared (not personal) bottles, so the bottle applicator tip and the oil bottle brush touched my toes and nails - and who knows if other clients before me had fungus or, worse, hepatitis.",
        "time": 1768499943,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jaspreet Kaur",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109074663699167342584/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUfzmroR8Nn0rCvidJ3EE6SUZKjDHsIKi_Cw_PcA7XUXBa37Oap1g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I absolutely loved the experience! Hanna was incredibly kind and did a beautiful job. The salon itself is stunning—clean, welcoming, and brimming with wonderful family-owned charm. However, I’m giving four stars because I experienced some discomfort in my nails for a few hours following the appointment.\n\nThis keeps your review professional and thoughtful while highlighting both the positive and constructive aspects.",
        "time": 1737126429,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Richard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107347509419992198011/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV7AprhecFCvbsxffezix2yAti4e5FvbxixOToblf0LSYlzKti9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "This is a great find, I am fortunate to have found them in my area of L'Ile Perrot.   Very courteous, professional and competent.  After years of neglect and abuse, my feet have never been happier.  Worth every penny and worthy of my 5-star rating !",
        "time": 1763919745,
        "translated": false
      }
